OL,3,GNEWSASearch for cruise ship passenger
OL,4,Afeared to have fallen overboard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major search has been launched for a
OL,7,Fpassenger feared to have fallen from a
OL,8,Fcruise ship docked in Dundee.
OL,10,FAmbassador Cruise Lines said the
OL,11,Fcaptain of the MS Ambition raised the
OL,12,Falarm after a man was reported missing
OL,13,Fbefore it arrived in the city from
OL,14,FLerwick earlier.
OL,16,FLifeboats and coastguard crews,
OL,17,Falongside aerial support, have been
OL,18,Fdispatched as part of the search.
OL,20,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said the
OL,21,Fman's next of kin were aware and
OL,22,Finquiries were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
